"""
Physualize v2 – Physics Visualization Engine
Dark Tkinter UI • Multiple simulation models • Smarter offline parser
Multi-stage problems: e.g. "a spring launches a block up a ramp" is split into
stages that run one after another, each drawn in its own panel, with the speed
and mass at the end of one stage carried into the next.
Optional: attached PNG/GIF diagrams are read by a vision model:
  • Ollama (default, free, local): install from https://ollama.com, then
    `ollama pull qwen2.5vl:7b`. No account or key needed; works offline.
  • Claude (online): `pip install anthropic` + the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY environment variable.
Without either, everything still works offline from the typed text.
"""

